  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the season with Jeminise's Cozy Christmas Quilt, designed to bring warmth and holiday spirit to your home. Crafted from premium microfiber, this quilt offers exceptional softness and breathability, ensuring year-round comfort while its vibrant festive prints add a cheerful touch to any room.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Adorned with bright, high-quality Christmas prints to create a warm and joyful atmosphere for your home decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, providing warmth in colder months and coolness during warmer seasons for versatile use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed and sofa dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present, perfect for Christmas, New Year, birthdays, anniversaries, or any holiday celebration for loved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle, and can be tumble dried low or air dried, maintaining its fade-resistant and wrinkle-free qualities.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal as a bedspread, a festive couch throw, or a warm companion for chilly nights and outdoor activities.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-ds07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
